#: 29a23903ab3843b99f9c2ff41bb28ec5
msgid "FrSky Telemetry is supported using the Tx pin of any UART excluding SERIAL3(UART3). To enable support for FrSky S.PORT (the example shows SERIAL6), you need to set the following parameters."
