#: a815c9bac50e4170afa07269d025ea78
msgid "The TAKER H743 BT supports analog OSD using its internal OSD chip and simultaneously HD goggle DisplayPort OSDs via the HD VTX connector."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:67
#: f092f04e7b474f7bae8fa4c796ff2654
msgid "VTX Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:68
#: 222ea8be13a54d97b11b850158835859
msgid "The SH1.0-6P connector supports a standard DJI HD VTX connection. Pin 1 of the connector is 12v (or VBAT selected by solder pad selection) so be careful not to connect to devices expecting 5v."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:71
#: dac78e5cfe44494da09062a518170ca5
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:72
#: da2646329877479bb8db6b63405539fe
msgid "The TAKER H743 BT supports up to 9 PWM/DShot outputs. The pads for motor output M1 to M4 are on the esc connector, M5-M8 are solder pads, plus M9 is defaulted for serial LED strip or can be used as another PWM output."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:74
#: 13d2bf18a93f4b47be57bd0083f8a905
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:76
#: 41915c4a6cff4ce1b685768cb83e06a3
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:77
#: b43aeb120be34ac5ad6604864d6859d5
msgid "PWM 5-6 in group2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:78
#: 82578a8f73bd4de287b7c941e2b2edc4
msgid "PWM 7-8 in group3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:79
#: 09ca06b553264b46a8538e8dd838f08e
msgid "PWM 9 in group4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:81
#: 7ec6db48de7a42be88ad4bbbebfc6364
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use DShot. Channels 1-8 support Bi-Directional DShot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:86
